# Telos, the Exchange (TSL, 208TEL, 203TEL, 204TEL): Loppak Slusk's
# suites: his captain Benok set on us (fought), the Gamorrean boss, Slusk's
# droids, then Slusk himself and Luxa: DSimpson's least violent way, Luxa
# turned on and a deal with Slusk to leave the Ithorians alone; the force
# cage's Ithorian freed from Slusk's terminal; back to Chodo, the reward
# politely refused (LSP, the lightsaber's energy cell fixture). Starts from
# the reception's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_exchange data/routes/tsl/telos_exchange.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Working for the Ithorians", Mission #2, and
# "Luxa, the Exchange and a Quarren Named Slusk" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
say I'm here representing Chodo Habat # Slusk won't listen; Benok and his
use door_203exlo     # goons attack
talk
fight 30
save telos_benok
bash door_203exes    # the next door, locked (DC 28, past Atton's Security):
                     # bashed (DSimpson: Security or bash)
use GamGuardLuxDoor  # up the hall, the Gamorrean boss at Slusk's door (one of
talk                 # Luxa's): Slusk sends out two war droids
fight 30
say I just want you to leave the Ithorians alone # once the droids are
say Can't we talk about this # down, Slusk's scene as his door opens
say That sounds like a good offer # (a_luxa): Luxa comes in; his offer
fight 30             # (Luxa's termination) taken, the least violent way
                     # (DSimpson); Luxa and her Gamorreans turn on us,
until 203TEL_Exchange_M=1 # and Slusk agrees to leave the Ithorians alone
save telos_slusk_deal
use CivilFootLker    # the office's footlocker and plasteel cylinders
use MilHighPlstcCylin@1
use MilHighPlstcCylin@2
say [Computer] Bypass secure login # Slusk's terminal: the force cage's
say Access remote camera controls # Ithorian freed
say Holding cells
say Deactivate Force Cage 2
use term_slusk
talk
save telos_slusk_done
exit Exchange        # out of the Exchange, and the terminal's transit back
module 203tel        # to the Ithorian compound
say Transit to another module
say Residential Module 082 West
use info_term
talk
module 204tel
say I have convinced Loppak Slusk # Chodo: the Exchange dealt with; his gift
say I cannot accept this from you # politely refused (LSP; the lightsaber
say How did Czerka imbed # energy cell fixture all the same); Mission 3:
say All right. I'll help you # Czerka's mainframe, a Czerka man in the
say Go on...                 # cantina who may help
say How do you propose
say I will see what I can do
use 204_Habat
talk
save telos_czerka_files
